# IMPORTANT: Set this in your Netlify environment variables
# Go to: Site settings > Environment variables > Add a new variable
# 
# For production (Netlify), set VITE_API_URL to your Render backend URL
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://smartcollege-server.onrender.com
#
# For local development, leave this commented out or empty
# The Vite proxy will handle API calls to localhost:10000

# VITE_API_URL=
